    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：茉莉、方向、章福贵、吴二乙</span></p><p><span>本期主持：萧旺</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/1fa4-audiofreehighqps/E8/81/GAqhJLsOOOntADzSkAS8Vaz1.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><span>.</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="277">00:04:37</a> 白皮出去黑皮回来的杭州之夏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">00:07:51</a> 夏天好啊老能换衣服</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">00:09:51</a> 夏天到底咋穿内衣啊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="858">00:14:18</a> 遍地都是高矮香臭人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">00:20:42</a> 体寒人在夏天有福了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">00:23:33</a> Milo布施环节到</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">00:34:00</a> 要凉快 开除湿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2448">00:40:48</a> 萧旺写真移步shownotes</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2901">00:48:21</a> 夏天大家都爱吃点儿啥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3853">01:04:13</a> 谁能做出不过敏的胸贴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4435">01:13:55</a> 小方向过的到底是什么日子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4776">01:19:36</a> 小福贵的暗恋结束在夏天</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5141">01:25:41</a> 老奶拉巨屎</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/4e1c-audiofreehighqps/C0/41/GAqhuykOOOmoAALwLQS8VYJx.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><span>.</span></p><p><b><span>音乐采样</span></b></p><p><span>宇多田ヒカル - 虹色バス</span></p><p><span>上海彩虹室内合唱团 - 夏天的梦是什么颜色的呢</span></p><p><span>.</span></p><p><span>制作：张1鸭、张1拿</span></p><p><span>剪辑：张1拿</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/3852-audiofreehighqps/02/D0/GKwRIDoOOOmMAAK35AS8VXGh.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mo