    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：梁彦增、刘仁铖、吴鼎、章福贵</span></p><p><span>本期主持：茉莉</span></p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/7fc8-audiofreehighqps/04/79/GAqhRAAN8xg6AALtAgShmUxK.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br><p><span>.</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="632">00:10:32</a> 就爱闻点儿书味</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="858">00:14:18</a> 你的kindle还好吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">00:18:15</a> 太有品味了 我的电子书架</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1383">00:23:03</a> 谁逐字读完四大名著了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1777">00:29:37</a> 拜读一下你小时候的著作</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2298">00:38:18</a> 页游广告你害人不浅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2637">00:43:57</a> 就爱看点搞对象的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2857">00:47:37</a> 图书馆老赖来了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3162">00:52:42</a> 青春期在爱的那些作者们</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3605">01:00:05</a> 你要唠漫画那我可不困了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4348">01:12:28</a> 恐怖小说 看得身上凉凉的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4660">01:17:40</a> 有些杂志害人不浅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4834">01:20:34</a> 贴画书涂色书太好玩了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5047">01:24:07</a> 看张爱玲对男人绝望了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5357">01:29:17</a> 偷偷看书的日子真的好困</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5740">01:35:40</a> 吴鼎有些口干舌燥了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5940">01:39:00</a> 不要施压了刘仁铖</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6191">01:43:11</a> 神奇父亲在这里</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6335">01:45:35</a> 所有人都去细品袁立文学</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6474">01:47:54</a> 传