  <item>
    <title>ep10.在这里我们不说想家 我们说…</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f7862bc429d55daa3d6eec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69f7862bc429d55daa3d6eec</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 16:40:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：茉莉、吴二乙、左右、老仔</span></p><p><span>本期主持：萧旺</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/cfee-audiofreehighqps/06/BB/GAqhy90NzT0MAALv7QST0Qt9.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><span>.</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">00:06:53</a> 芜湖！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="577">00:09:37</a> 真假宋城 豆包评评理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">00:14:44</a> 我6岁就开始杭漂了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">00:19:20</a> 大连的海鸥很会拉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1342">00:22:22</a> 茉莉家族抢劫般的亲情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1577">00:26:17</a> 马迭尔面包你就吃吧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">00:28:23</a> 橘生赣州则为最好的脐橙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">00:30:50</a> 尔滨牛腰 好吃不骚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2051">00:34:11</a> 焖子到底谁家的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2186">00:36:26</a> 没想爸妈 有点想狗了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">00:40:39</a> 好温柔的茉莉妈妈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">00:46:30</a> 我就是妈宝男怎么了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3076">00:51:16</a> 那年6岁 我妈考上了研究生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3164">00:52:44</a> 521是整个家里学历最低的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3435">00:57:15</a> 海的味道 大连知道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3749">01:02:29</a> 甲鱼的脚丫子可太好吃了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5211">01:26:51</a> 锅包肉怎么能有巧克力味儿的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5379">01:29:39</a> 朱庆祥永远不死</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6622">01:50:22</a> 我是山的孩子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6844">01:54:04</a> 广东人的脚是有主体性的</span></p><span>.</span><p><b><span>音乐采样</span></b></p><p><span>宇多田ヒカル - 虹色バス</span><br><span>死亡圆周率 - 大东北是我的家乡</span><br><span>.</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/3a65-audiofreehighqps/4B/68/GKwRIRwNzT1TAAQpsQST0RWf.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br><span>.</span></p><p><span>制作：张1鸭、张1拿</span></p><p><span>策划：张1鸭、张1拿</span></p><p><span>剪辑：张1拿</span></p>]]></description>
