    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Apr 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：鱼仔，春雨，茉莉，吴二乙</span><br><span>本期主持：萧旺</span><br><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/754c-audiofreehighqps/90/F0/GKwRIaINuj8aAAKnSQSMn04R.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br><span>.</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">00:03:50</a> 主播们是有胜负心的人嚒？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">00:09:12</a> 春雨：遇到男的我胜负心拉满</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">00:13:14</a> 鱼仔的胜负欲写在脸上</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">00:17:48</a> 所有人打开小红书看一点即兴在长剧赛的精彩表现</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1336">00:22:16</a> 吴二乙什么时候能不拿亚军</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1684">00:28:04</a> 吴二乙一边走路一边给自己解说</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">00:31:35</a> 鱼仔、偷快递的、快递站老板的爱恨纠缠（这巧克力到底多好吃啊？）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2840">00:47:20</a> 萧旺被网约车司机抛弃在高架上</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3317">00:55:17</a> 茉莉点到了只有挞没有蛋的蛋挞</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4102">01:08:22</a> m当劳和s巴克</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4402">01:13:22</a> 花花：我乐意撕点东西</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5310">01:28:30</a> 萧旺被前女友出轨事件</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5777">01:36:17</a> 输的时候如何调理嘞</span><br><span>.</span><br></p><p><b><span>音乐采样</span></b><br><span>宇多田ヒカル - 虹色バス</span><br><span>旅行团乐队 - 量贩人生路</span><br><span>.</span><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/05b0-audiofreehighqps/9E/73/GAqhQKINuj9lAASkNQSMn2p_.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><span>.</span></p><p><span>制作：张1鸭、张1拿</span></p><p><span>策划：张1鸭、张1拿</span></p><p><span>剪辑：张1鸭</span></p>]]></description>
