    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：茉莉、双喜、吴二乙</span></p><p><span>本期主持：萧旺</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/f38c-audiofreehighqps/B4/74/GAqhcW4NsTGwAAMiZwSJJw_H.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><span>.</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">00:03:43</a> 绝交当然要跟同事啦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">00:12:20</a> 你的绝交触发机制是什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="911">00:15:11</a> 双喜：我比较怕蠢货和疯子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="959">00:15:59</a> 王涛返场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">00:17:35</a> 人在自卑的时候好无礼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">00:22:52</a> 谁断一点翅膀 我就在播客骂你</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1531">00:25:31</a> 我要跟理发店绝交</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1872">00:31:12</a> 和朋友的敌人说话就要判死刑吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2172">00:36:12</a> 一点即兴双喜事件</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3205">00:53:25</a> 0人知道萧旺生气了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3783">01:03:03</a> 双喜别哭</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4132">01:08:52</a> 一点即兴短视频时间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4610">01:16:50</a> 糊涂人不要挑战自己了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5097">01:24:57</a> 她甩了我一巴掌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5465">01:31:05</a> 友谊也忌偷吃</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5864">01:37:44</a> 磨刀霍霍向老师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6452">01:47:32</a> hello？我是大床房吗</span></p><span>.</span><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/446e-audiofreehighqps/7E/30/GAqhEnUNsTI3AAP0swSJJ1Zm.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><span>.</span></p><p><span>【音乐采样】</span></p><p><span>宇多田ヒカル - 虹色バス</span></p><p><span>Spylent - Faith（信任）</span></p><p><span>.</span></p><p><span>制作：张1鸭、张1拿</span></p><p><span>策划：张1鸭、张1拿</span></p><p><span>剪辑：张1拿</span><br></p>]]></description>
