    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Apr 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：吴鼎、春雨、茉莉、吴二乙</span><br><span>本期主持：萧旺</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/3cc4-audiofreehighqps/58/39/GAqhEnUNp-ffAAij3gSFTbAO.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br><span>.</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">00:01:14</a> 开场游戏——你有我没有</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="674">00:11:14</a>5 要想考得好，必须得穿耐克和紫色裤衩</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="931">00:15:31</a> 主播们教你如何大露痕迹地作弊</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1318">00:21:58</a> 吴鼎在幼儿园玩“密室逃脱”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1414">00:23:34</a> 茉莉去学农，同学唱雨爱</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2291">00:38:11</a> 萧旺初中被砍事件（毫发无伤版）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2473">00:41:13</a> 吴二乙因为最矮获得了帮主的职位</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">00:46:10</a> 萧旺：如何让小女孩迷蒙我（别轻易学习）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3066">00:51:06</a> 茉莉学校的大姐头翅膀被折了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3391">00:56:31</a> 发小因为被霸凌后成为反社会人格</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3726">01:02:06</a> 室友洗澡要洗两个小时</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3913">01:05:13</a> 超哥和达哥</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4104">01:08:24</a> 我那有钱有权有才的班长</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4706">01:18:26</a> 我的机器人专利被偷了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5004">01:23:24</a> 班花班草的虐恋</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5394">01:29:54</a> 我成为了外国人play的一环</span><br><span>.</span><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/edbc-audiofreehighqps/8B/2C/GAqhT9ENp-giAA1ZIgSFTc_G.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><span>.</span></p><p><span>【音乐采样】</span><br><span>宇多田ヒカル - 虹色バス</span><br><span>THE BOOTLEGS 靴腿 - 小孩儿</span></p><p><span>.</span><br><span>制作：张1鸭、张1拿</span><br></p><p><span>策划：张1鸭、张1拿</span></p><p><span>剪辑：张1鸭</span></p>]]></description>
